OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief asks secretary of
OL,4,Astate to review Drumcree determination
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) Chief Constable Jon Boutcher has
OL,8,Fasked the secretary of state to review
OL,9,Fthe Parades Commission determination
OL,10,Fallowing the Drumcree parade, BBC News
OL,11,FNI understands.
OL,13,FBoutcher triggered the move under the
OL,14,FPublic Processions (Northern Ireland)
OL,15,FAct 1998 earlier on Friday.
OL,17,FIt comes as First Minister Michelle
OL,18,FO'Neill confirmed she has received a
OL,19,Fletter from police investigating
OL,20,Fprotests over the Drumcree parading
OL,21,Fdispute.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
