OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief asks secretary of
OL,4,Astate to review Drumcree determination
OL,5,
OL,6,FPortadown deputy District Master
OL,7,FAlastair Power said there would be
OL,8,F"serious consequences" if the Northern
OL,9,FIreland secretary intervened to stop
OL,10,Fthe march.
